# TUH EEG Seizure Corpus v2.0.3 (TUSZ)
#
# Download: https://isip.piconepress.com/projects/tuh_eeg/html/downloads.shtml
#
# Expected structure:
# tusz/edf/train/ → Training split (4438 sessions)
# tusz/edf/dev/ → Development split (1013 sessions)
# tusz/_DOCS/ → Official documentation
#
# Each session contains:
# - *.edf files (10-20 montage, 19 channels, variable sampling rates)
# - *.csv_bi files (event annotations)
#
# Pipeline: EDF → preprocess → cache/tusz_mmap/{train,dev}/*.npy
